{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-hot-reloader#card-zh","repo":"xfgil/dsh-hot-reloader","commit":"3064f1e43676380b6b80238c6b27a3810b05f9ff","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-reloader（DSH 桌面宿主插件）：监视已安装插件的源码变化，并在运行中的宿主内重载，让开发者无需重启即可查看修改效果。它通过 DSH loader 定位插件，扫描 JavaScript 和 JSON 文件，等待写入稳定后清理包内模块缓存并重建实例。支持自动或手动重载、按包筛选、暂停扫描及查看状态日志。适合 DSH 插件开发者。需要启用 Node loader internals（--expose-internals），无需 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:271-300","lib/index.js:320-347","lib/index.js:368-426","lib/index.js:429-561","lib/index.js:787-878","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-hot-reloader#card-en","repo":"xfgil/dsh-hot-reloader","commit":"3064f1e43676380b6b80238c6b27a3810b05f9ff","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-hot-reloader watches DSH plugin source and reloads changes without restarting. It scans JavaScript and JSON, clears the cache, and rebuilds instances. Developers can trigger reloads, pause scans, and view status. Requires Node loader internals (--expose-internals); no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:271-300","lib/index.js:320-347","lib/index.js:368-426","lib/index.js:429-561","lib/index.js:787-878","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
