{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-hot-reloader#feature-watch","repo":"xfgil/dsh-hot-reloader","commit":"3064f1e43676380b6b80238c6b27a3810b05f9ff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-reloader 的功能「源码变更监视」：定期扫描已定位插件包中的 JavaScript 与 JSON 文件，对比文件时间和大小；首次扫描只建立基线，后续变化才进入重载流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:271-300","lib/index.js:320-357","lib/index.js:612-653"]}
{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-hot-reloader#feature-reload","repo":"xfgil/dsh-hot-reloader","commit":"3064f1e43676380b6b80238c6b27a3810b05f9ff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-reloader 的功能「自动重载」：检测到源码变化后等待防抖间隔，再清理目标包的 ESM 与 CommonJS 缓存并重建插件实例；重建失败时尝试恢复旧实例。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:368-426","lib/index.js:429-561","lib/index.js:655-715"]}
{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-hot-reloader#feature-control","repo":"xfgil/dsh-hot-reloader","commit":"3064f1e43676380b6b80238c6b27a3810b05f9ff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-reloader 的功能「手动控制」：通过宿主 HTTP 路由按插件名称触发重载，或切换自动扫描的启用状态；支持指定包和全部包。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:742-759","lib/index.js:811-837"]}
{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-hot-reloader#feature-status","repo":"xfgil/dsh-hot-reloader","commit":"3064f1e43676380b6b80238c6b27a3810b05f9ff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-reloader 的功能「状态查看」：读取本地状态路由可查看扫描文件数、扫描与重载次数、失败数、监听包、近期结果和日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:787-810","lib/index.js:848-878"]}
{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-hot-reloader#caveat-internals","repo":"xfgil/dsh-hot-reloader","commit":"3064f1e43676380b6b80238c6b27a3810b05f9ff","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-reloader 使用前须知：重载需要 DSH loader 的 Node 内部接口，宿主未以 --expose-internals 启动时无法工作；代码在初始化时检查该条件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:146-169","README.md:76-91"]}
{"unit_id":"xfgil__dsh-hot-reloader#caveat-reload-state","repo":"xfgil/dsh-hot-reloader","commit":"3064f1e43676380b6b80238c6b27a3810b05f9ff","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hot-reloader 使用前须知：重载会移除并重建目标插件实例，代码保留包内模块缓存的回滚路径，但插件运行时状态是否恢复取决于实例重建。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:368-426","lib/index.js:506-561"]}
